*.txt        notes.txt                     match
*.txt        notes.txt.bak                 no match
note?.txt    note1.txt                     match
[a-c]*       banana                        match
[!a-c]*      banana                        no match
*            src/main.a                    match
*            src/main.a     FNM_PATHNAME   no match
src/*.a      src/main.a     FNM_PATHNAME   match
*            .hidden                       match
*            .hidden        FNM_PERIOD     no match
*.TXT        notes.txt                     no match
*.TXT        notes.txt      FNM_CASEFOLD   match
a\*b         a*b                           match
